omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yX_8hmsHyn4Q7kNvwGByJCc&_nc_oc=AdrpV3_194fF1aaWPwAo55D-0f0012xtvrOX2DyCJ2PcrYUYsFjJiMbn-egSJs_JfBs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnts4m8oPLQr-lX5K3l5bsHOoEu7CHDBOdaEFPxxkJ2g&oe=6AF48834"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EAVsJ9CypU8Q7kNvwGgkxCH&_nc_oc=AdofOUtHajJtSaylTbkXTbaLgYISubkPaJYjKPWm8n4g68jwMDZMb7vvX48A3uxlW2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQYuTU1h8g_Mf5vONGkf3m12aXlDMUwOGYjuAsj_AwNIw&oe=6AF48996"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h-TIDfGWvBEQ7kNvwHOxnI-&_nc_oc=Ados36l4lB64kdcUaVt2dV47ZgV_qBSbtCOOJN3zlVui7Y6HgGPplO6m6L02pcFxANk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhwGDlvwAFHdtkXQ9E8R9Uwk1JybVgndmwd5e-vZcQFg&oe=6AF49EB7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://